      "content": "TRING RURAL            PUTTENHAM SP 81 SE 3/137                                   Plinth for statue on -                                       E side of entrance at                                         Grange Farm GV                                      II Plinth for statue. C18 (associated with 2 statues both dated 1741 and signed Jan Van Logttaren). Brought with statues from The Green Park, Aston Clinton c.1948. Carved stone. A square plinth about 1M high with rebated corners and sunk front panel dying into outswept base with Roccoco relief decoration in panel. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP8858614693"
